{
 "source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart",
 "precision": "tts",
 "offset": 0,
 "duration": 125.401,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Every change to hareet.ai starts as a sentence, and ends with a person's merge.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 4.924
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the intent: what's wanted, and why, in the words of whoever wants it.",
   "start": 5.174,
   "end": 9.418
  },
  {
   "text": "The Author accepts it or closes it, and the survival rate is published.",
   "start": 9.668,
   "end": 13.709
  },
  {
   "text": "A spec-writer agent turns it into a spec, with acceptance criteria a test can check.",
   "start": 13.959,
   "end": 19.236
  },
  {
   "text": "Its questions go to the Author, and the answers are kept word for word.",
   "start": 19.486,
   "end": 23.446
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the plan: the files, the order, the risks, the cost, and what happens when it degrades.",
   "start": 23.697,
   "end": 28.61
  },
  {
   "text": "It's approved before any code exists.",
   "start": 28.86,
   "end": 30.893
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the tasks, and a read-only check that the spec, the plan, and the tasks agree.",
   "start": 31.143,
   "end": 35.566
  },
  {
   "text": "An implementer agent builds it on a feature branch, task by task, with tests.",
   "start": 35.816,
   "end": 40.45
  },
  {
   "text": "And every new feature brings its own telemetry, a dashboard panel, a cost estimate, its degraded behavior, and a disclosure row if a byte leaves your device.",
   "start": 40.7,
   "end": 50.613
  },
  {
   "text": "A reviewer agent, read-only, and never the one that wrote it, checks the change for bugs, security, compliance, and cost.",
   "start": 50.862,
   "end": 57.852
  },
  {
   "text": "Its findings inform the merge;",
   "start": 58.103,
   "end": 59.882
  },
  {
   "text": "they never replace it.",
   "start": 60.131,
   "end": 61.336
  },
  {
   "text": "Changing a feature works the same way.",
   "start": 61.587,
   "end": 63.53
  },
  {
   "text": "A newer spec names each clause it amends, and when the code departs from the plan, the plan is corrected in the same commit.",
   "start": 63.78,
   "end": 70.92
  },
  {
   "text": "A bug starts as a failing test.",
   "start": 71.169,
   "end": 72.913
  },
  {
   "text": "During a fix, a hook stops the agent from editing tests: fix the code, not the test.",
   "start": 73.163,
   "end": 78.295
  },
  {
   "text": "An incident gets a note within seven days, with the eval that would have caught it.",
   "start": 78.545,
   "end": 82.77
  },
  {
   "text": "When the kill switch trips, the gateway drafts that incident itself, from a template, with no model call.",
   "start": 83.02,
   "end": 88.779
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the Author merges, a clean-room gate runs every check on an export of the branch, with the network cut off, so nothing an agent left behind can run.",
   "start": 89.03,
   "end": 98.308
  },
  {
   "text": "The agents work in a sandbox, on their own container engine, behind hooks that refuse pushing, merging, applying infrastructure, editing budgets, or reading secrets.",
   "start": 98.558,
   "end": 109.089
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of forbidden actions are tested on every run.",
   "start": 109.339,
   "end": 112.522
  },
  {
   "text": "Deploys only pull: the same images, by digest, from a release made from main, and rolled back if the health checks fail.",
   "start": 112.772,
   "end": 120.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The agents type.",
   "start": 120.37,
   "end": 121.409
  },
  {
   "text": "The Author decides.",
   "start": 121.659,
   "end": 122.808
  },
  {
   "text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.",
   "start": 123.058,
   "end": 125.4
  }
 ],
